text = "Qorix is an extensively modified, independently developed fork of [url=https://github.com/face-hh/griddycode][color=#b4a7d6]GriddyCode[/color][/url], the original project by [url=https://youtube.com/facedevstuff][color=#b4a7d6]Face[/color][/url], licensed under the Apache License 2.0 and maintained & extended by [url=https://github.com/Nadeem-vibes][color=#b4a7d6]Mohamed Nadeem[/color][/url].

[font_size=85][color=#b6b6b6]The upstream project went unmaintained for over 2 years. The original code belongs to [url=https://github.com/face-hh/griddycode][color=#b4a7d6]Face[/color][/url]; Qorix adds the integrated terminal, the code runner & more. Face does not endorse Qorix.[/color][/font_size]

Shortcuts:
CTRL + O     - open file picker. Navigate with ↑ ↓ ⏎
CTRL + SHIFT + O - open a folder as the workspace.
CTRL + SHIFT + E - toggle the file explorer.
CTRL + SHIFT + F - search across files.
CTRL + ,     - open settings.
CTRL + T     - open theme picker.
CTRL + I     - open this panel.
CTRL + L     - open the comments.
CTRL + S     - save the current file.
CTRL + SHIFT + S - save as (choose a new path).
CTRL + N     - new untitled file.
CTRL + SHIFT + T - reopen the last closed tab.
CTRL + Z     - undo.
CTRL + Y     - redo.
CTRL + = / - - zoom the view in / out.
CTRL + W     - close the current file.
CTRL + F     - find in file.
CTRL + H     - open find & replace.
CTRL + P     - quick open files.
CTRL + SHIFT + P - command palette.
CTRL + `     - toggle terminal.
CTRL + SHIFT + ` - new terminal tab.
CTRL + ALT + K - edit keyboard shortcuts.
CTRL + ALT + N - run the current file (alternate shortcut).
CTRL + ALT + M - stop the run (alternate shortcut).
F5           - run the current file.
SHIFT + F5   - stop the run.
[font_size=85]
